# Docs site (SPEC.md §11.2 — Astro + ui-kit). All three are generated —
# .astro is Astro's type cache — and the site is published from the workflow,
# never from a committed build. docs/package-lock.json IS committed, so a clean
# checkout builds with `npm ci` in docs/.
docs/node_modules/
docs/dist/
docs/.astro/

# Go build output. `cmd/codiq` arrives at M2 and `go build` drops the binary in
# the package directory by default; the coverage and profile files are what the
# test flags leave behind.
/codiq
/cmd/codiq/codiq
*.test
coverage.out
*.prof

# Editor / OS noise.
.DS_Store
